From e49ba2592dddf2826014deafdf922e74bde1851c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mark Hatle <mark.hatle@amd.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 19:21:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] amd_boot_image_loader: Add file_type field

Due to the versal 2vp having multiple formats for the file, we
need a way to determine which file_type was processed so we can
do further processing.  Add this information to the loader and
test scripts.

Upstream-Status: Pending

Signed-off-by: Mark Hatle <mark.hatle@amd.com>
---
 amd_boot_image_loader/loader.py         | 15 +++++++++++++++
 amd_boot_image_loader/versal.py         |  3 +++
 amd_boot_image_loader/versal_2ve_2vm.py |  3 +++
 amd_boot_image_loader/versal_2vp.py     |  7 +++++++
 amd_boot_image_loader/versalnet.py      |  3 +++
